# Build context for the sandbox image is the MONOREPO ROOT (docker build -f _apps/sandbox/Dockerfile .).
# Keep every workspace member's source — `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` inside the image validates the whole
# workspace against the root lockfile, and `pnpm --filter @intentic/{sandbox,cli,iq} deploy` prunes the final
# image to the core packages. Exclude only artifacts, vcs, secrets, and things the core image never needs.
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.turbo
**/.cache
**/dist
**/dist-bin
**/dist-*
**/deploy
**/generated
**/.astro
**/out-tsc
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
_tools/localhost-https
.demo
desired-state
intent
test
